0..75 Comment "// A list of optional values standing where a body ends: each element takes"
76..153 Comment "// the element type the body answers, as a constructor at the same tail takes"
154..230 Comment "// the answer itself. `Maybe` is the one `data-maybe.gandr` declares. Before"
231..308 Comment "// #1602 each constructor among the elements was refused for want of a stated"
309..381 Comment "// type. The result is written without its returner, `-> List(T)`, which"
382..442 Comment "// answers its element type as `-> -F List(T)` does (#2255)."
444..486 Comment "/// Optional values, `None` and `Some(x)`."
